- **Code** — implement `erode_binary(mask, kernel)` from scratch, 4 tests (1 visible smoke + 3 hidden), full solution
- **Quiz** — multi-select with 3 correct of 5 options, distractors drawn from `research.md` misconceptions (grayscale morphology, open/close commutativity)
- **Sandbox** — `cv2.morphologyEx` playground with synthetic mask (square with holes + salt + letter T)
5 sources mixing kinds (3 articles, 2 books — Serra 1982 and Gonzalez & Woods 2018 with author/year), plus per-section sources on the two theory sections. `LessonSchema.safeParse` returns success.
